        "original_id": "289f0803-3792-53de-9454-f510db6a3859",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Diplo, Justin Bieber, DJ Khaled, David Guetta, Quavo, Chance the Rapper, Lil Wayne\n- Songs: \"Bankroll\", \"I'm the One\", \"2U\"\n- Platforms: SoundCloud\n\nFacts:\n- \"I'm the One\" is a song written and performed by DJ Khaled, Justin Bieber, Quavo, Chance the Rapper, and Lil Wayne.\n- Justin Bieber was originally featured on Diplo's song \"Bankroll\".\n- Justin Bieber already had exclusives with DJ Khaled on \"I'm the One\" and with David Guetta on \"2U\" around the time Diplo released \"Bankroll\".\n- Diplo removed the original version of \"Bankroll\" from his SoundCloud account because of Justin Bieber's existing exclusives.",
